# git push --atomic origin main v1.0.0

### read
GET https://gitlab.com/alice/site.git/info/refs?service=git-receive-pack
user-agent: git/2.53.0
accept: */*

### write base64
POST https://gitlab.com/alice/site.git/git-receive-pack
